WEBVTT

00:06:59.832 --> 00:07:02.042
She said, “The staff here
are just going to see

00:07:02.042 --> 00:07:03.794
a sick old lady in the hospital bed,

00:07:03.794 --> 00:07:05.421
someone who’s weak and confused.

00:07:05.921 --> 00:07:07.673
It’s easy to think that’s all I am.”

00:07:08.466 --> 00:07:11.302
She said, “I want them to understand
what we’re working for.

00:07:11.594 --> 00:07:13.679
Sometimes you have to
see it to believe it.”

00:07:14.096 --> 00:07:15.097
If I’m honest,

00:07:15.097 --> 00:07:17.183
I have to admit
that sometimes I was the one

00:07:17.183 --> 00:07:19.727
who just saw the sick old lady
in the hospital bed.

00:07:19.727 --> 00:07:21.979
And trying to capture
my mom’s goal in a picture

00:07:21.979 --> 00:07:23.731
helped me believe in it more myself.

00:07:25.941 --> 00:07:27.193
My mom did reach her goal,

00:07:27.193 --> 00:07:28.319
and a few months later,

00:07:28.319 --> 00:07:30.738
she walked out of the hospital
on her own two feet.